Expected Result: These login attempts should be denied with authentication errors.

Subtask 3.3: Verify HBAC Rule Evaluation
Use FreeIPA's built-in testing tools to verify rule evaluation.

# Test HBAC rule evaluation for specific scenarios
ipa hbactest \
  --user=jdeveloper \
  --host=client1.example.com \
  --service=sshd

# Test denied scenario
ipa hbactest \
  --user=ccontractor \
  --host=client2.example.com \
  --service=sshd

# Test with detailed output
