Subtask 3.5: Test Rule Modifications
Modify rules and test the changes take effect.

# Add temporary access for contractor to db-servers
ipa hbacrule-add-host contractor_limited_access --hostgroups=db-servers

# Test the new access
ssh ccontractor@client2.example.com

# Remove the temporary access
ipa hbacrule-remove-host contractor_limited_access --hostgroups=db-servers

# Verify access is revoked
ssh ccontractor@client2.example.com
